# Base64 32-byte key issued by the CrazyGames developer portal.
# VITE_CRAZYGAMES_ENCRYPTION_KEY=

# Which portal this build talks to: crazygames (default), poki, or none.
#
# Fixed at build time on purpose — each portal hosts its own copy of the build
# and loading two ad SDKs into one page is neither allowed nor sensible. Do not
# set this here for a Poki build; `npm run build:poki` supplies it via
# `.env.poki`, which is committed precisely so the Poki build is reproducible.
# VITE_PLATFORM=
